**Excel | Financial Analysis | PivotTables | KPI Development | Dashboarding | Efficiency Analysis | Comparative Analysis | Business Planning Support | Management Reporting**

## Business Value

The project demonstrates how financial and operating data can be combined to compare markets, assess resource allocation and identify performance differences that may support budgeting, planning and management review.

