# How the Projects Work Together

The projects are intentionally different because each demonstrates a different part of the analytics workflow:

- The **SuperStore project** demonstrates retail analysis, Excel PivotTables, dashboards, KPI reporting and data-quality awareness.
- The **Financial project** demonstrates financial comparison, efficiency metrics and management-oriented business analysis in Excel.
- The **Sales, Client & Branch SQL project** demonstrates relational database design and progressively advanced SQL analysis.
- The **Interior Fittings project** demonstrates a complete business analytics model combining sales, inventory, customers, procurement, budgets, forecasting and automated reporting.
- The **SPSS research project** demonstrates quantitative research, data coding and statistical analysis from the academic stage of the analytics journey.

Together, the portfolio covers the main stages of a Data Analyst workflow:

**Collect / Structure Data → Validate Data → Analyse Performance → Identify Trends → Build KPIs → Segment / Rank → Forecast / Plan → Report Findings → Support Decisions**

